# Same-origin proxy alternative for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# Use this INSTEAD of setting VITE_AGENT_BASE (.env.production) if you'd rather
# the client call a relative `/api/*` on the Pages origin and have Pages proxy
# it to the deployed Worker. To activate: copy this file to `public/_redirects`
# (drop the `.example`), replace the Worker URL with yours, and build with
# VITE_AGENT_BASE UNSET so the client uses the relative `/api` base.
#
# The 200 status makes this a proxy/rewrite (not a 30x redirect), so POST bodies
# and the SSE stream pass through. Pick ONE approach — this OR VITE_AGENT_BASE,
# not both (if VITE_AGENT_BASE is set the client calls the Worker directly and
# this file is never consulted).
#
# /api/*  https://overclocked-worker.YOUR-SUBDOMAIN.workers.dev/api/:splat  200
